---
import { SAMPLE_ROWS, CUT_SHARE, sampleTotals, money, signed } from "../lib/sampleMemo";
const t = sampleTotals();
const cut = SAMPLE_ROWS[1];
---
<article class="d-memo" aria-labelledby="memo-title">
  <p class="d-memo-stamp"><span>Sample anonymized memo</span><span>Illustrative figures, not a client account</span></p>
  <div class="d-memo-body">
    <div class="d-memo-title"><h2 id="memo-title">7Captur Monday Decision Memo</h2></div>
    <dl class="d-memo-meta">
      <div><dt>Account</dt><dd>[Sample Anonymized Brand]</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Window</dt><dd>Trailing 30 days (settled) vs. prior 30 days</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Evidence grade</dt><dd><span class="d-grade">MODERATE</span></dd></div>
    </dl>

    <h3>Executive readout</h3>
    <p>Ad platforms reported blended <strong>{t.roas.toFixed(1)}x ROAS</strong> on <strong>{money(t.spend)}</strong> spend. After reconciling declared SKU COGS, payment processing fees, shipping, and settled 30-day refunds, true net contribution was <strong class="d-pos">{signed(t.net)}</strong>, with the retargeting catalogue losing cash.</p>

    <h3>Platform ROAS vs. true margin</h3>
    <table class="d-ledger">
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Channel / campaign group</th><th scope="col" class="num">Spend</th><th scope="col" class="num">Platform ROAS</th><th scope="col" class="num">True net margin</th><th scope="col">7Captur call &amp; evidence</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {SAMPLE_ROWS.map((r) => (
          <tr class={r.net < 0 ? "is-loss" : undefined}>
            <th scope="row">{r.channel}</th>
            <td class="num" data-label="Spend">{money(r.spend)}</td>
            <td class="num" data-label="Platform ROAS">{r.roas.toFixed(1)}x</td>
            <td class={`num ${r.net < 0 ? "d-neg" : "d-pos"}`} data-label="True net margin">{signed(r.net)}</td>
            <td><span class="d-call">{r.call}</span><span class="d-call-note">{r.note}</span></td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
      <tfoot>
        <tr>
          <th scope="row">Blended</th>
          <td class="num" data-label="Spend">{money(t.spend)}</td>
          <td class="num" data-label="Platform ROAS">{t.roas.toFixed(1)}x</td>
          <td class="num d-pos" data-label="True net margin">{signed(t.net)}</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
      </tfoot>
    </table>

    <div class="d-decision">
      <h3>This week's decision</h3>
      <p>Reduce Meta Retargeting Catalogue by {CUT_SHARE * 100}% ({money(cut.spend * CUT_SHARE)} less spend per 30 days) due to an 18.4% return rate on Bundle B. Do not scale Google PMax until the open refund window settles on next Monday's memo.</p>
    </div>
    <p class="d-unknown"><strong>Unknowns flagged:</strong> 3 new SKUs are missing COGS entries. They are excluded from scale calls rather than treated as $0 cost.</p>
  </div>
</article>
